  "prefLabel": "Bea 505.03 Community Outreach and Engagement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 505.03 Community Outreach and Engagement. Municipalities participating in any of the 4 grant phases shall engage in a public community outreach and engagement process during which the municipality shall solicit support and feedback from stakeholders and the general community and to promote public awareness of the activities being undertaken.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bea500.html"
